            "content": "<p><strong>LELO SWITCH™</strong> is made from <strong>body-safe silicone and ABS plastic</strong> with a smooth finish designed for premium comfort. It measures <strong>217 x 64 x 43 mm</strong>, has an <strong>insertable length of 83 mm</strong>, and weighs <strong>167 g ±10%</strong>. The device is powered by a <strong>3.7V 1000 mAh lithium battery</strong> and charges in <strong>less than 2 hours</strong>.</p><p>It offers <strong>up to 2 hours of use time</strong>, automatically <strong>shuts off every 20 minutes</strong>, and provides <strong>up to 90 days of standby time</strong>. The top motor operates at <strong>100 Hz</strong>, while the handle motor operates at <strong>93 Hz</strong>, with a <strong>maximum noise level under 63 dB</strong> for a more discreet experience. SWITCH™ includes a simple <strong>3-button interface</strong> with <strong>2 LED lights</strong> and connects to the <strong>LELO™ app</strong> for remote control, partner play, and custom vibration patterns.</p>",
