            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>One of the standout qualities of <strong>LELO SWITCH™</strong> is its ability to combine <strong>versatility, smart technology, and luxurious design</strong> in one beautifully streamlined device. Instead of being limited to one style of stimulation, it gives you the flexibility to enjoy both external and internal pleasure in a way that feels smooth, intuitive, and highly customizable. This makes it especially appealing for users who want more variety from one premium product.</p><p>Its app connectivity, sensory ridges, soft silicone finish, and dual-motor design also make it feel more advanced and immersive than a standard vibrator. Elegant, modern, and thoughtfully engineered, <strong>SWITCH™</strong> is an excellent choice for anyone looking for a multifunctional pleasure device that blends smart features with refined comfort and satisfying performance.</p>",
